From 118b94944307c7158ca0f3f4124b829408fcfdd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 May 2021 10:48:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 104/196] Update currency unit to `Lotus` and redenominate to
 10^6 (#175)

Switch from BCHA to Lotus as the currency unit, and redenominate to
1 COIN = 10^6 sats instead of 10^8 sats. This is easier for people to
reason about as it follows the MKS decimal system.
